No tests found for this module. The fix is applied. Here's what changed:

**File:** `src/import_merge.ts`

**Bug:** Line 7 compared URLs with strict equality (`b.url === inc.url`), which is case-sensitive. Hostnames in URLs are case-insensitive per RFC 3986, so `https://example.com/a` and `https://EXAMPLE.com/a` should be treated as the same URL.

**Fix:** The match now compares hostnames case-insensitively using `new URL(b.url).hostname.toLowerCase() === new URL(inc.url).hostname.toLowerCase()`. If URL parsing fails (malformed URL), it falls back to the original exact string comparison as a best-effort safety net.


